  "prefLabel": "En 502.13 Landfill gas operator",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 502.13 \"Landfill gas operator\" means a person who engages in the transportation of landfill gas off site from the premises in which it was gathered except where the landfill gas is transferred in a pipeline that operates at less than atmospheric pressure from the premises where it was gathered to the premises where it is used and where both premises are controlled by the same entity.\n\nSource. #13796, eff 10-25-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/en500.html"
}
